    Added interactive behavior to product cards.

    On hover:

    Product card slightly elevates.
    Product image receives subtle visual emphasis.
    Add-to-cart button becomes more prominent.
    Transition animation provides visual feedback.

    This makes the catalog feel more interactive without overwhelming the user.

